        "Statement B matches the drawing because the customer is pointing at a loaf of bread held by the baker to purchase it (« Je voudrais ce pain bien cuit, merci. »). Statement A is contradicted because asking for stamps refers to a post office, C refers to a train station platform, and D refers to handing a prescription to a pharmacist.",
